OL,3,GNEWSA'It gives me freedom I never
OL,4,Athought I'd have' - breaking down
OL,5,Abarriers to water sports
OL,6,
OL,7,FNaomi Herron had not been on a beach
OL,8,Fsince she was a child.
OL,10,FShe has cerebral palsy which meant it
OL,11,Fwas difficult for her to the access the
OL,12,Fbeach as she grew up.
OL,14,FNaomi only returned five years ago
OL,15,Fafter campaigning with a charity for
OL,16,Fbeaches to become more accessible for
OL,17,Fthose with disabilities.
OL,19,FThe Mae Murray Foundation works to
OL,20,Fremove physical barriers to activities
OL,21,Flike water sports.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
